AllerTOP / AllergenFP

Proteins in food or enivornment act as allergens.
Through this they could predict in advance - which protein might cause allergy before using it medicines or vaccines.

AllerTOP:

It predicts whether a protein is an allergen or non-allergen
It uses ML methods.
* Helps in designing safer vaccines / drugs & foods.
Like a Topper , uses algorithms based on protein properties.

AllergenFP:

Based on descriptor fingerprints of proteins 
Simple, alignment-free method.
Fast & reliable to screen large sets of proteins.
Fingerprint -it's structures features.



